    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d983-a1">

                <pb facs="1120" n="1024" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg1024"/>

                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Havana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-01-12"><hi rendition="#italic">January 12,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Much excitement, which may develop into serious disturbances. The trouble
                    commenced by those who oppose autonomy, and so far is directed against those who
                    advocate it. No rioting at present, but rumors of it are abundant. Palace
                    heavily guarded. Consulate also protected by armed men.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
